{# DeD Cum — body-state facts. INFORMATIVE ONLY, never directive. Tier-0
   (unmarked) renders NOTHING. Windowed: DeD_Cum_PromptShow opens ~1 min per
   10 min of marked time, reopened immediately on application, so state
   updates land without hygiene-style repetition (the 0171 windowing
   precedent applied to cum). Brace-balanced.

   REV-133 (2026-10-19) — THE NULL-HARDENING + THE PER-LOCATION CONSTRUCTION
   (register entry 26's design directive). Errors fixed from the 132b draft:
   (1) the bio lane's actor variable is actorUUID (0171 precedent), NOT
   actor_uuid — the 132b draft's actor_uuid was an UNKNOWN VARIABLE (the
   RenderTemplate error class; PromptEngineRender.cpp:372 receipts);
   (2) actor must come from decnpc(actorUUID) (0171 precedent), NOT a bare
   undefined actor; (3) every numeric read is guarded (default() + isNumber,
   the beta-28 prompt-file-syntax.md function table) so no comparison can
   see null/undefined. NULL CONTRACT (psc side, REV-133): freshness_s is
   always an Int >= 0 (never null); locations is always a well-formed
   (possibly empty) array; present false = {"present": false} only; tier
   reads 0 when the arousal framework is absent.

   DESIGN CHOICE (flagged, per the task): BRANCHES-INSIDE-LOOP — the location
   for-loop runs FIRST and each location's phrase is chosen by per-location
   branch, with the freshness band applied as a single surrounding sentence.
   Loop-inside-bands was rejected: freshness is wearer-level (one band per
   render), so wrapping the loop in the bands would duplicate the band text
   per location. The phrase table below is STRATEGIST DRAFT (s7: entry 26's
   batch — the user rules the family once). VERDICT STATUS: this bio surface's
   decorator behavior is untested on beta-28 (132b receipts; REV-133 4.1:
   the session's render errors were RESPONSE-CONTENT lane + unknown-variable
   class, NOT this lane) — first enabled render = verdict (a)/(b) LIVE; an
   error box = NOT (escalate). The user's entry-26 ruling gates INSTALL. #}
